The faces in this folder are the temet design system's type faces, as TTF files from its
ui/build/fonts (pushed commit 6cbc790). Each family's folder holds its licence and a SOURCE.txt
naming the upstream repository and commit.

- Archivo, by the Archivo Project Authors: SIL Open Font License 1.1 (archivo/OFL.txt).
- Big Shoulders Display, by the Big Shoulders Project Authors: SIL Open Font License 1.1
  (big-shoulders-display/OFL.txt).
- IBM Plex Mono, by IBM Corp.: SIL Open Font License 1.1, the IBM Plex licence
  (ibm-plex-mono/LICENSE.txt).
